      "name": "Nature of Plan",
      "esop:summary": "Establishes plan purpose — employee ownership and capital accumulation. Qualifies as ESOP under IRC §4975(e)(7) and stock bonus plan under IRC §401(a). Second restatement effective January 1, 2011.",
