      "@type": "esop:DefinedTerm",
      "name": "AnnualAdditions",
      "esop:definition": "Aggregate of Contributions, Forfeitures, and voluntary contributions credited to Participant Accounts each Limitation Year. Excludes restored forfeitures and rollovers.",
