      "@type": "esop:DefinedTerm",
      "name": "CoveredCompensation",
      "esop:definition": "Total Compensation including 401(k)/125 deferrals; excludes expense allowances, fringe benefits, moving expenses, welfare benefits, and deferred comp (except 401k/125). Effective 2009 includes differential wage payments (HEART '08).",
