      "@id": "esop:Term_AlternatePayee",
      "@type": "esop:DefinedTerm",
      "name": "Alternate Payee",
      "esop:definition": "A spouse, former spouse, child or other dependent of a Participant who is recognized by a Domestic Relations Order as having a right to receive all or a portion of the benefits otherwise payable to a Participant. See Section 18(e) of the Plan.",
